<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-assassination-rogue-dps">
<span class="c4">Shoulders for Assassination Rogue DPS</span></h4>The 2-set from <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60462/vicious-gladiators-leather-spaulders">
<img alt="Vicious Gladiator's Leather Spaulders" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_152.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vicious Gladiator's Leather Spaulders</span></a> makes the PvP shoulders your best option for Pre-BiS. Even though the 2nd option has expertise, the red gem socket gives <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56273/caridean-epaulettes">
<img alt="Caridean Epaulettes" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_152.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Caridean Epaulettes</span></a> a slight edge over <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58134/embrace-of-the-night">
<img alt="Embrace of the Night" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_153.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Embrace of the Night</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62346/greater-inscription-of-shattered-crystal">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Shattered Crystal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_goldendraenite_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Shattered Crystal</span></a> from being Exalted with the <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1171/therazane">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Therazane</span></a>
