<span class="c4">Neck for Assassination Rogue DPS</span></h4>Just like the cloak slot, the technical pre-bis here would be <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67137/don-rodrigos-fabulous-necklace">
