<img alt="Mouth of the Earth" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mouth of the Earth</span></a> or <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62378/acorn-of-the-daughter-tree">
<img alt="Acorn of the Daughter Tree" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_food_pinenut.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Acorn of the Daughter Tree</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
