<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-assassination-rogue-dps">
<span class="c4">Rings for Assassination Rogue DPS</span></h4>Your primary ring will definitely be <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62362/signet-of-the-elder-council">
<img alt="Signet of the Elder Council" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_diamondring2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of the Elder Council</span></a>. The second best ring is easily <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68812/hornet-sting-band">
<img alt="Hornet-Sting Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_82.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hornet-Sting Band</span></a> from Valor Points with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67136/gilnean-ring-of-ruination">
<img alt="Gilnean Ring of Ruination" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_emeraldstonering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gilnean Ring of Ruination</span></a> being another good option for pre-bis. The best dungeon ring that we can acquire would be <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56412/ring-of-blinding-stars">
<img alt="Ring of Blinding Stars" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_starring3.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of Blinding Stars</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Ring Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74216/enchant-ring-agility">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Agility</span></a> -  Only Enchanters may apply Ring Enchants on their own rings.<div class="pad"></div>
