<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62362/signet-of-the-elder-council">
<img alt="Signet of the Elder Council" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_diamondring2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of the Elder Council</span></a></td>
