<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-assassination-rogue-dps">
<span class="c4">Trinkets for Assassination Rogue DPS</span></h4>Your first trinket is BiS for all of P1 being <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58181/fluid-death">
<img alt="Fluid Death" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_vehicle_liquidpyrite_blue.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fluid Death</span></a> purchased with Valor Points. The second trinket is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68709/unsolvable-riddle">
<img alt="Unsolvable Riddle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_stonetablet_11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unsolvable Riddle</span></a> and comes from being exalted with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1177/baradins-wardens">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Baradin's Wardens</span></a>. Being able to line up its strong on use effect with every <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=79140/vendetta">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_rogue_deadliness.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vendetta</span></a> ends up packing a much stronger punch than it was originally given credit for. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56394/tias-grace">
<img alt="Tia's Grace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_ammo_arrow_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tia's Grace</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56328/key-to-the-endless-chamber">
<img alt="Key to the Endless Chamber" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_key_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Key to the Endless Chamber</span></a> remain adequate trinkets until you can unlock <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68709/unsolvable-riddle">
<img alt="Unsolvable Riddle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_stonetablet_11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unsolvable Riddle</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
