<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-hand-weapons-for-assassination-rogue-dps">
<span class="c4">Main Hand Weapons for Assassination Rogue DPS</span></h4>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56302/steelbenders-masterpiece">
<img alt="Steelbender's Masterpiece" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_cataclysm_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Steelbender's Masterpiece</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55068/elementium-shank">
<img alt="Elementium Shank" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_grimbatolraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Shank</span></a> are essentially interchangeable. If you find yourself not having luck with the dungeon drop then the crafted dagger is an easy option to grab.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52776/enchant-weapon-landslide">
<img alt="Enchant Weapon - Landslide" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Landslide</span></a>. Your main-hand poison will be <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=6947/instant-poison">
<img alt="Instant Poison" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_poisons.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Instant Poison</span></a>
