<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="off-hand-weapons-for-assassination-rogue-dps">
<span class="c4">Off Hand Weapons for Assassination Rogue DPS</span></h4>All of the off hand options are relatively close to one another, but <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56335/quicksilver-blade">
