<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="guns-bows-and-thrown-weapons-for-assassination-rogue-dps">
<span class="c4">Guns, Bows, and Thrown Weapons for Assassination Rogue DPS</span></h4>The method for acquiring your pre-bis <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68162/spinerender">
<img alt="Spinerender" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_24.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spinerender</span></a> requires a lot of pickpocketing and some rng, making <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56420/slashing-thorns">
<img alt="Slashing Thorns" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_throwingchakrum_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Slashing Thorns</span></a> the most realistic pre-bis option available for Thrown weapon specifically. The <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59367/kickback-5000">
<img alt="Kickback 5000" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_rifle_44.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Kickback 5000</span></a> comes in slightly behind <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68162/spinerender">
<img alt="Spinerender" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_24.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spinerender</span></a> as a solid stat stick for situations when you don't need to press <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=51723/fan-of-knives">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_rogue_fanofknives.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fan of Knives</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
<b>Recommended BiS Ranged Poison</b>: If you do have a thrown equipped, your poison will be <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=2892/deadly-poison">
<img alt="Deadly Poison" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_rogue_dualweild.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Deadly Poison</span></a>
